Indestructible Aura
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
